// Alien Ship Pack: eight ships of Tyrian's two alien races:
// the Hazudra (Trent's allies, episodes 2 and 5) and the Zica (builders of the
// tunnel worlds, masters of thermal energy, see the Zica Laser data cube).
//
// The images are drawn in the style of the original ships: 24x28 canvas,
// the game's VGA palette (indices measured on 12 original ships), one-pixel
// dark outline, one body ramp + one accent ramp. Each ship
// provides its five poses (ship_poses): neutral, half and full bank to each
// side, drawn as a roll (the cockpit slides toward the turn, the lowered wing
// shortens and darkens). 40 PNGs: the ship image table has 44 free places
// for all enabled mods.
//
// Price and armor matched to the original ships of the same tier (see the
// README table). All eight are sold everywhere (always_available); a
// shop shows at most 10 ships, the level's own included (MODDING.md §5.9).
